    "long_instructions": "## Exploring Text Styles\r\n\r\nNotice that there is a new section of our webpage called `<style>`. This defines the rules for how the webpage should look.\r\n\r\nIn this level, we'll use AI Tutor to help us understand rules that change how text appears: `font-size`, `text-decoration`, and `font-weight`, and add new text styles to our webpage.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1) Ask AI Tutor to explain how the rules for `font-size`, `text-decoration`, and `font-weight` work.\r\n    - You can send AI Tutor a message directly, or highlight the code and select \"Add to AI Tutor\"\r\n2) Ask AI Tutor to add `font-size`, `text-decoration`, or `font-weight` styles to the headers and paragraphs on this page. \r\n    - Use specific language, like \"`bold`\" or \"`font-size` in px\", to make sure AI follows your vision.\r\n\r\nOnce you've styled the headers and paragraphs: press the Continue button!",
